  "sourceTitle": "Barbecue Spare Ribs",
  "sourceText": "Barbecue Spare Ribs\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 11:26pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 pounds lean pork ribs\nOnions\n1/2 cup catsup\n1/2 cup vinegar\n1 1/2 teaspoons paprika\n1/4 cup water\n1 1/2 teaspoons chili powder\n1 tablespoon steak sauce\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Grease pan and fry ribs fast until brown with onions and without a lid. 2 Put in pressure cooker with catsup, vinegar, paprika, water, chili powder, and steak sauce and cook for 30 minutes.",
